00:02:57.683 --> 00:02:59.843
<v Vocab>見ごろ

00:03:00.243 --> 00:03:05.883
<v Host>It means the best time to see something — when flowers or autumn leaves look most beautiful.

00:03:06.484 --> 00:03:16.108
<v Slow>花の名前は、「レモンブライト」です。レモンのような、明るい黄色です。

00:03:16.907 --> 00:03:22.235
<v Host>The flower's name is Lemon Bright. It is a bright yellow, like a lemon.

00:03:22.836 --> 00:03:25.139
<v Vocab>明るい

00:03:25.539 --> 00:03:29.163
<v Host>It means bright — full of light, like a sunny color.

00:03:29.764 --> 00:03:40.515
