00:04:18.987 --> 00:04:22.971
<v Host>It means a kind or a type — different varieties of something.

00:04:23.572 --> 00:04:31.540
<v Slow>コスモスまつりは、10月25日の日曜日まで続きます。

00:04:32.339 --> 00:04:36.899
<v Host>The cosmos festival continues until Sunday, October twenty-fifth.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:39.755
<v Vocab>続く

00:04:40.156 --> 00:04:43.588
<v Host>It means to continue — to go on without stopping.

00:04:44.187 --> 00:04:51.124
<v Slow>秋の一日、公園にコスモスを見に行きませんか。

00:04:51.923 --> 00:04:56.172
<v Host>Why not spend an autumn day going to the park to see the cosmos flowers?

00:04:56.771 --> 00:04:58.860
<v Vocab>秋

00:04:59.259 --> 00:05:05.187
<v Host>It means autumn — the season of cool air, red leaves, and flowers like these.

